---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="NEXUS AI privacy policy — how we handle data, cookies, and your rights.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 lg:py-20">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-8">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6 text-[var(--text-secondary)]">
      <p class="text-lg">
        <strong class="text-[var(--text-primary)]">Last updated:</strong> February 2026
      </p>

      <section class="nexus-card p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>NEXUS AI collects only the information you voluntarily provide through our contact form, including your name, email address, and message content. We do not use cookies for tracking or analytics beyond basic functionality.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="nexus-card p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>Information submitted via our contact form is used solely to respond to your inquiry. We do not sell, trade, or share your personal information with third parties.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="nexus-card p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">3. Data Storage</h2>
        <p>This website is hosted on GitHub Pages. Contact form submissions are processed through Formspree. No user data is stored on our servers.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="nexus-card p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">4. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You may request deletion of any personal data you have submitted to us by contacting us through our contact page. We will process your request within 30 days.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="nexus-card p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">5. Contact</h2>
        <p>For privacy-related inquiries, please use our <a href="/contact" class="text-quantum-blue hover:underline">contact page</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
